{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\eng\\045.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Comprehension Questions", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[65, 198], [508, 195], [508, 229], [66, 232]]}, {"text": "What is the moral of the story?", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[103, 243], [479, 243], [479, 272], [103, 272]]}, {"text": "b.If you were the crow, how would you convince the snake not to eat the eggs?", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[63, 287], [1017, 280], [1018, 310], [63, 317]]}, {"text": "C.", "conf": 0.635, "box": [[69, 335], [92, 335], [92, 356], [69, 356]]}, {"text": "If you were the snake, do you think you can outsmart the crow?", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[112, 329], [858, 322], [859, 352], [112, 358]]}, {"text": "Use of Language", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[126, 398], [415, 403], [414, 440], [125, 435]]}, {"text": "Adjectives", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[68, 487], [204, 485], [205, 514], [69, 517]]}, {"text": "Adjectives are words that describe or modify a noun or a pronoun by describing,", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[69, 522], [1013, 516], [1014, 548], [70, 555]]}, {"text": "identifying or quantifying words. It normally indicates quality, size, age, shape, colour", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[68, 562], [1068, 555], [1068, 585], [69, 592]]}, {"text": "and opinion.", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[71, 601], [225, 601], [225, 628], [71, 628]]}, {"text": "Example:", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[70, 637], [182, 637], [182, 668], [70, 668]]}, {"text": "She saw theprincess wearing an exgnsive necklace.", "conf": 0.865, "box": [[69, 677], [687, 674], [688, 703], [69, 706]]}, {"text": "The word 'expensive'describes the noun (necklace).", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[70, 714], [678, 712], [678, 741], [70, 743]]}, {"text": "The story about the 'Clever Crow'is full of interesting adjectives which add to the", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[70, 764], [1097, 760], [1097, 793], [70, 796]]}, {"text": "atmosphere of the fable. Find the adjectives in the sentences and write them on the", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[69, 796], [1122, 793], [1122, 823], [69, 826]]}, {"text": "space provided.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[68, 831], [274, 827], [274, 857], [69, 861]]}, {"text": "a.", "conf": 0.592, "box": [[73, 881], [96, 881], [96, 904], [73, 904]]}, {"text": "Please, spare my eggs, dear friend.", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[119, 876], [528, 876], [528, 906], [119, 906]]}, {"text": "b.", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[71, 933], [101, 933], [101, 959], [71, 959]]}, {"text": "\"Let us live like good neighbours and not disturb each other', the crow said.", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[120, 932], [1004, 932], [1004, 961], [120, 961]]}, {"text": "Whenever the crow laid eggs, the snake would eat them up.", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[120, 985], [822, 989], [822, 1018], [120, 1015]]}, {"text": "d.", "conf": 0.602, "box": [[73, 1043], [100, 1043], [100, 1070], [73, 1070]]}, {"text": "The crow felt helpless.", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[121, 1040], [385, 1044], [384, 1074], [120, 1070]]}, {"text": "e.", "conf": 0.643, "box": [[70, 1103], [96, 1099], [99, 1125], [73, 1129]]}, {"text": "The crow felt angry and she thought, \"I must teach that snake a lesson.\"", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[121, 1097], [969, 1100], [969, 1132], [121, 1129]]}, {"text": "f.", "conf": 0.64, "box": [[71, 1154], [93, 1154], [93, 1185], [71, 1185]]}, {"text": "With big sticks, they beat the snake and killed it.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[123, 1155], [690, 1156], [690, 1186], [123, 1185]]}, {"text": "g.", "conf": 0.589, "box": [[75, 1216], [101, 1216], [101, 1245], [75, 1245]]}, {"text": "The crow was happy.", "conf": 0.842, "box": [[124, 1209], [370, 1214], [369, 1243], [123, 1239]]}, {"text": "h.", "conf": 0.661, "box": [[76, 1271], [109, 1271], [109, 1295], [76, 1295]]}, {"text": "\"Now my eggs will be safe,\" she thought and flew away happily.", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[111, 1266], [870, 1267], [870, 1303], [111, 1302]]}, {"text": "aw", "conf": 0.632, "box": [[223, 1374], [340, 1277], [384, 1329], [267, 1427]]}, {"text": "38", "conf": 0.641, "box": [[591, 1583], [634, 1583], [634, 1614],